Loki (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/7CIVAl4HiuWrmp4r8Jk09sqxTBy.jpg","tmdbId":19868},{"name":"Rahul Kohli","character":"Egill (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/9wTBpyPhyDRUfgR1MGSmsILuZ8d.jpg","tmdbId":1416505},{"name":"Jamie Clayton","character":"Seid-Kona (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/5b5p7qq1Qy0emhEmKK7xJ7kfllj.jpg","tmdbId":1440698},{"name":"Birgitte Hjort Sørensen","character":"Hervor (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/nFWcco0Z1Ic50g7YfZlaUrjBiEp.jpg","tmdbId":90514},{"name":"Thea Sofie Loch Næss","character":"Thyra (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/k0aq1OjmVp9psvNx4JAXQovbHqc.jpg","tmdbId":1384976}],"writers":[{"name":"Jay Oliva","character":"Jay Oliva","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/y7EbnuoKFMvU7uZ4aD50jThyNoF.jpg","tmdbId":105643},{"name":"Eric Carrasco","character":"Eric Carrasco","photo":null,"tmdbId":1703171},{"name":"Zack Snyder","character":"Zack Snyder","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/iD0GDqkvJXDXiNEZej198hjt3Tt.jpg","tmdbId":15217}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saXZfP0xqkp6nWrs8N6WuXo4SF5.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt10625492:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"El precio de la novia","overview":"La boda de Sigrid con el rey Leif termina en tragedia cuando Thor desata su furia en plena ceremonia... y desencadena el juramento de venganza de la novia.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3V4oGABJvHEjMh49QRXRHEpJ5Xm.jpg","released":"2024-09-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"33 min"},{"id":"tt10625492:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"La lanza hereje","overview":"En el inframundo, Loki pone en marcha un plan. Sigrid y Leif reclutan a una banda de guerreros y salen en busca de hierro para matar a los dioses.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tWgl2NmRUJk2D7XN0RRHr5ZF6CQ.jpg","released":"2024-09-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"28 min"},{"id":"tt10625492:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Alimentarás a sus cuervos","overview":"Los cazadores de Odín atacan al grupo de Sigrid en su camino al lejano Vanaheim. Thor enfrenta a su amenaza mortal... cara a cara.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zUeqzDwgxiIlHBaKj8tEzvl9nci.jpg","released":"2024-09-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"27 min"},{"id":"tt10625492:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"El gusano","overview":"Cuando los Vanir les piden un saco de manzanas encantadas, los guerreros deben luchar contra la bestia que resguarda el huerto y bañar sus armas en sangre.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nfUXAEltR7wwuOlaLS9b1jnsPCu.jpg","released":"2024-09-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"31 min"},{"id":"tt10625492:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"El chivo expiatorio","overview":"Leif y Loki quedan atrapados en un reino maldito. Una manada de los primeros lobos ayuda a los guerreros. La historia de Sigrid atrae un sorprendente ejército de nuevos aliados.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/taPAcml5aiUQLy3dzFbi675QmDx.jpg","released":"2024-09-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"tt10625492:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Esta es la historia de...","overview":"La noche antes de la batalla, Sigrid y sus compañeros comparten historias fantásticas de magia y honor. La pasión se enciende por todo el campamento, y Odín lanza una advertencia.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/NQiVBHUJoui5MtuKp5OrdtS9e4.jpg","released":"2024-09-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"tt10625492:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Si yo tuviera un martillo","overview":"Comienza la batalla épica, en la que mortales, gigantes y Vanir se enfrentan a Thor y sus soldados Aesir. Una arriesgada misión secreta termina con sangre derramada.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hn7fZxmCIE5pY4e8Mji59FOdXUI.jpg","released":"2024-09-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"28 min"},{"id":"tt10625492:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"El cantar de Sigrid","overview":"El reinado de los dioses pende de un hilo, mientras se forjan leyendas, caen héroes y se revelan motivos ocultos. Odín experimenta una impactante revelación.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Q04n54nElkbaaBQoPhPO9xYuaE.jpg","released":"2024-09-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"42 min"}]}}